"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[526],{8526:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"en":{"labels":{"updated":"Last updated: November 15, 2026","operator":"Operated by IDEASpike. Contact:"},"privacy":{"title":"Privacy Policy","body":"<h2>What the app does</h2><p>Prices Nearby reads product price tags and compares nearby price observations. Uploaded photos stay owner-only. When you confirm a scan, its validated product, price, conditions, observation time and public store location may be shared in other users’ comparisons. Your original photo and precise capture coordinates are not shown in those comparisons.</p><h2>Information we process</h2><p>We process your email and account identifier for sign-in, the photo you choose or take, capture time and time zone, photo GPS when present, and the phone location available when you capture or select the photo. Recognition, store matches, corrections and feedback are linked to the scan. Service identifiers, errors, processing times and model usage help operate and diagnose the app. Apple product and transaction information, credit purchases, balance changes and funded-result records support purchase delivery, charging and fraud prevention. We do not receive payment-card details from Apple.</p><h2>Providers and location</h2><p>AWS provides account authentication, protected photo storage and store matching. Store matching uses OpenStreetMap and AWS location services; location information may be sent to AWS. OpenAI processes a photo copy without embedded metadata to recognize product and price information. Raw GPS coordinates are not sent to OpenAI, but information visible in the photo is included. Provider use and retention follow OpenAI API data controls. Processing may occur outside your country, including the United States. Phone location access is optional and used while the app is in use; denying it does not remove location information already present in a selected photo. The system photo picker accesses only the selected photo.</p><h2>Retention and local cache</h2><p>Cloud photos and their stored versions are scheduled to expire after 90 days. Scan records, feedback and individual price contributions are retained for up to one year. Service diagnostics are generally retained for 30 days. Account information and purchase balances remain while you maintain your account; routine data cleanup does not expire purchased Credits. Once an account-deletion request is accepted, further account use is blocked and associated personal scan records, price contributions and cloud photo versions are removed within seven days. Limited purchase and refund records remain for accounting, fraud prevention and Apple transaction handling, with a one-way account reference and without email, username, photos, location or comparison snapshots. Protected disaster-recovery backups may persist for up to 35 days; deletion must be reapplied before restored data is returned to active use.</p><p>The local photo cache is isolated by account and limited to 64 MiB, with older cache entries removed when full rather than by a fixed age. Photos are protected, excluded from backups, and cleared on sign-out or account deletion. The app does not add photos to the Photos library. Completed comparisons are saved separately in protected local History, excluded from backups. Signing out hides that account’s History; these local records remain until account deletion, local data removal or app removal. Cloud or photo-cache cleanup does not remove saved comparison results.</p><h2>Your choices and assistance</h2><p>Before sharing a new photo with OpenAI, the app asks for explicit permission for the signed-in account on that device. You can cancel without uploading. You may deny phone location access, mark incorrect information and sign out. Use only photos you have permission to share and avoid including people or unnecessary personal information. Use Settings → Account → Delete account to request deletion; confirm your password and the final warning. The app states when the request has been accepted and signs you out. Deletion removes your personal scans, photos and linked price contributions, while independently collected prices and other contributors’ records remain. Unused Credits are no longer accessible; deletion does not request an Apple refund or transfer Credits. Removing the app clears local files but does not delete online records. Contact support@ideaspike.com for access, correction or privacy questions; we may verify account control. Applicable privacy rights remain available.</p><h2>Optional diagnostic feedback</h2><p>You can send issues and corrections for a scan to help diagnose a problem. Sending this feedback is separate from uploading the photo or confirming a price observation. It does not publish a price record or charge Credits. Unsent feedback may remain on your device until sent or removed.</p><h2>Other services and updates</h2><p>The app includes no advertising or cross-app tracking SDK. Apple’s App Store and device services have their own policies. Opening website links sends normal web request information to the destination; information you send to support is used to respond. We update this product-specific policy when processing changes. For information about our privacy practices and our service providers, including processing outside your country, contact the IDEASpike Privacy Contact at support@ideaspike.com.</p>\\n<p><a href=\\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/your-data\\">OpenAI API data controls</a></p>"},"terms":{"title":"Terms of Use","body":"<h2>Price observations</h2><p>Prices Nearby helps compare observed product prices. Recognition, store matching and unit conversions may be incomplete or incorrect. Observations can become outdated; stock, taxes, membership, promotion dates, purchase limits and package differences can affect the checkout price. Check the label and store before purchasing. A comparison is not a reservation, a retailer offer, or a guarantee of savings.</p><h2>Your account and submissions</h2><p>Keep account access secure. Upload only photos you have rights and permission to share. Do not fabricate price labels, misrepresent stores, submit unlawful content or abuse the service. Your photos remain yours; you allow us and our service providers to store and process them to provide recognition, comparisons and problem investigation. Confirming a scan can share its validated price observation and public store location, as described in the Privacy Policy. Source photos are not publicly posted.</p><h2>Confirmed price facts</h2><p>When you confirm a price observation, you grant IDEASpike a non-exclusive, royalty-free licence to host, use, correct, aggregate, analyse and publish product, store, price, package or unit, applicable price-condition and observation-time facts solely to operate and improve Prices Nearby. This does not authorise public display of your source photo, account identity or precise capture coordinates. Account deletion removes your linked price contributions. Independently sourced prices and other contributors’ records are unaffected.</p><h2>Review and availability</h2><p>A scan with no detected price tag ends without manual product/price submission. Review marks and corrections help identify mistakes; they do not guarantee the accuracy of the result. Features depend on supported iOS versions, connectivity and service providers.</p><h2>Credits and funded results</h2><p>The current app supports prepaid Credits. Recognition and submitting price observations are free. Access to an eligible delivered lower-price comparison uses 1 Credit for that scan; no lower price, an unavailable result, or diagnostic-only feedback is not charged. Reopening or refreshing an already-funded scan does not charge it again. Check the displayed result-access action before confirming. A comparison does not guarantee that a retailer will honor a price observation.</p><p>Paying a Credit does not extend or restart cloud retention. Completed comparisons are saved in protected local History for you to reopen without another Credit. Cloud or photo-cache cleanup does not remove those saved results. Signing out hides that account’s local History. Account deletion, clearing local data or removing the app removes it. Purchase recovery does not recreate deleted local History.</p><h2>Purchases, recovery and refunds</h2><p>The current catalogue offers a one-time consumable pack of 10 Credits, with the available price and currency displayed by Apple. This is not a subscription. Purchased Credits do not expire because of time or inactivity; they are service-use units, not deposits or investments. Credits are delivered to the app account used for purchase after transaction verification. Use the same app account and reopen the app while connected to retry interrupted delivery automatically; retries do not grant the same transaction twice or restore spent Credits. Do not buy again to resolve a completed purchase. Apple handles refund requests at reportaproblem.apple.com, subject to eligibility and applicable law. If Apple reverses a purchase, the service removes the remaining unspent Credits from that purchase rather than taking unrelated purchased Credits or creating a negative balance. Reporting a problem is not itself a refund request. Account deletion does not automatically request a refund, transfer Credits or restore a balance. Requests concerning unused purchased Credits are handled under the applicable purchase terms and law.</p><h2>Licence and intellectual property</h2><p>For App Store downloads, Apple’s Standard EULA governs the app licence unless a custom EULA is provided for your country or region through App Store Connect. These Terms supplement the applicable EULA and govern IDEASpike accounts, online services, app content and paid entitlements, where offered. Subject to that agreement and these terms, IDEASpike grants you a limited, personal and non-transferable licence to use the service for its intended purpose. IDEASpike and its licensors retain all rights in the app, software, design and supplied content.</p><h2>Service changes and contact</h2><p>IDEASpike may update, suspend or discontinue the service. Where practicable, we will give reasonable advance notice and stop new Credit sales before a planned permanent closure. To the extent permitted by law, the service is provided as available without additional warranties beyond those expressly stated in these terms or required by law, and IDEASpike is not liable for indirect or consequential loss arising from reliance on price observations or service interruption. Changes or closure do not remove applicable contractual or statutory remedies for unused paid Credits or services not supplied. App Store refund requests follow Apple’s process. Nothing in these terms excludes liability or consumer rights that cannot be excluded under applicable law. Updates appear on this page; contact support@ideaspike.com for purchase, access or deletion assistance.</p><h2>Store directory sources</h2><p>The store directory includes OpenStreetMap data under the Open Database License. See <a href=\\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\\">OpenStreetMap attribution</a> and the <a href=\\"https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/\\">ODbL 1.0 license</a>. A directory match does not imply retailer endorsement.</p>"},"support":{"title":"Prices Nearby Support","body":"<h2>Good Price Nearby</h2><p>Photograph a complete product price tag to compare nearby observations. Keep the label readable in the dashed guide; recognition uses the whole photo. A photo without a detected price tag ends the scan.</p><h2>History and store matches</h2><p>Scan History reopens completed comparisons saved on this device without another Credit. Cloud or photo-cache cleanup does not remove those saved results. Clearing local data, signing out, deleting your account or removing the app removes local history; purchase recovery does not recreate it. A bounded local photo cache avoids repeat downloads. Photo GPS takes priority over the phone’s current position. Visible store names and branch addresses guide matching. Without photo GPS, the app falls back to phone location and automatically uses the best available supported-store match, including when stores are close together. No store confirmation is required; location warnings are informational. A store match is not proof of the branch. Review corrections before submitting them.</p><h2>Credits and purchase help</h2><p>Open Credits to review your available balance and Apple’s current 10-Credit offer. Only a delivered lower-price result costs 1 Credit; recognition, no-result scans and diagnostic feedback do not. Reopening an already-funded scan does not charge again. If delivery is interrupted, reopen the app while connected using the same app account; unfinished purchases retry automatically. A pending or unverified transaction does not establish delivery. Do not purchase again to fix an existing payment. Apple refund requests use reportaproblem.apple.com.</p><h2>Diagnostic feedback</h2><p>Mark an incorrect field and use Send for diagnosis when offered. The photo has already been uploaded for recognition; this sends the diagnostic decision and issue information. Report saved means the report is queued locally; Report received confirms delivery. Reconnect to retry. A diagnostic report does not publish a confirmed price observation or guarantee a personal reply.</p><h2>Get help</h2><p>Email <a href=\\"mailto:support@ideaspike.com\\">support@ideaspike.com</a> with the app version and a short description. Include a scan ID only when you are asking us to investigate that scan. Do not email passwords, sign-in codes, payment-card details or unnecessary personal photos. Use Delete Account in account settings to delete your account and associated personal cloud data. For help with unused purchased Credits, you can contact support before deleting your account. Uninstalling alone does not delete the online account.</p>"}},"zh-Hans":{"labels":{"updated":"更新日期：2026 年 11 月 15 日","operator":"运营者：IDEASpike。联系："},"privacy":{"title":"隐私政策","body":"<h2>应用提供什么</h2><p>附近价格读取商品价签并比较附近的价格记录。上传照片仅供所属账户查看。你确认扫描后，通过验证的商品、价格、条件、观察时间及公开门店位置可能出现在其他用户的比价结果中。原始照片和精确拍摄坐标不会在这些结果中显示。</p><h2>处理的信息</h2><p>我们处理用于登录的邮箱和账户标识、你选择或拍摄的照片、扫描时间与时区、照片自带的 GPS，以及拍摄或选图时可用的手机位置。识别结果、门店匹配、修正及反馈与扫描记录关联。服务标识、错误、处理耗时和模型用量用于运行及排查问题。Apple 商品和交易信息、点数购买、余额变动及已付点数的结果记录用于购买到账、扣点和防止欺诈。我们不从 Apple 接收银行卡资料。</p><h2>服务商与定位</h2><p>AWS 提供账户认证、受保护照片存储和门店匹配。门店匹配使用 OpenStreetMap 和 AWS 定位服务；位置信息可能发送给 AWS。OpenAI 处理已移除嵌入元数据的照片副本，识别商品和价格信息。原始 GPS 坐标不会发送给 OpenAI，但照片画面中可见的信息会包含在请求中。服务商的使用和保留方式遵循 OpenAI API 数据控制。处理可能发生在你所在国家以外，包括美国。手机定位可选，仅在使用应用时使用；拒绝手机定位不会移除所选照片中已有的位置信息。系统选图器只访问所选照片。</p><h2>保存期限与本地缓存</h2><p>云端照片及其存储版本安排在 90 天后过期。扫描记录、反馈和个人价格贡献最多保存一年。服务诊断通常保存 30 天。账户信息和点数余额在账户存续期间保留；日常数据清理不会让已购买点数过期。账户删除请求被接受后，账户将不能继续使用，相关个人扫描记录、价格贡献和云端照片版本会在七天内删除。为记账、防欺诈和处理 Apple 交易而保留的少量购买及退款记录，使用单向账户引用，不包含邮箱、用户名、照片、位置或比价快照。受保护的灾难恢复备份可能保留最多 35 天；恢复的数据在重新投入使用前必须再次应用删除要求。</p><p>本地照片缓存按账户隔离，上限为 64 MiB，满额时清理旧缓存，不按固定天数过期。照片受到保护、不参与备份，并在退出登录或删除账户时清理。应用不会把照片加入系统照片图库。已完成的比价结果单独保存在受保护且不参与备份的本地扫描历史中。退出登录会隐藏该账户的历史；记录会保留到删除账户、清除本地数据或卸载应用。云端或照片缓存清理不会删除已保存的比价结果。</p><h2>你的选择与协助</h2><p>首次向 OpenAI 发送新照片前，应用会针对当前设备上登录的账户征求明确许可。取消不会上传照片。你可以拒绝手机定位、标记错误信息或退出登录。请仅使用有权分享的照片，避免包含人物或不必要的个人信息。在“设置 → 账户 → 删除账户”中发起删除，并确认密码和最终警告。应用会明确显示请求已接受，然后退出登录。删除会移除你的个人扫描、照片和关联价格贡献，独立采集的价格及其他贡献者的记录不受影响。未使用点数将无法继续访问；删除不会申请 Apple 退款或转移点数。卸载应用会清理本地文件，但不会删除在线记录。关于访问、更正或隐私问题，请联系 support@ideaspike.com；我们可能核验账户控制权。适用的隐私权利仍然有效。</p><h2>可选诊断反馈</h2><p>你可提交扫描问题和修正，帮助排查问题。发送此反馈与上传照片或确认价格记录是不同操作，不会发布价格记录，也不扣点数。尚未发送的反馈可能保留在设备上，直至发送或移除。</p><h2>其他服务与更新</h2><p>应用不包含广告或跨应用跟踪 SDK。Apple 的 App Store 及设备服务适用其自身政策。打开网站链接会把常规网页请求信息发送到目标网站；你发给支持邮箱的信息用于回复。处理方式改变时会更新本应用专属政策。 如需了解我们的隐私处理方式及服务商的相关政策和做法，包括境外处理，请通过 support@ideaspike.com 联系 IDEASpike 隐私联系人。</p>\\n<p><a href=\\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/your-data\\">OpenAI API 数据控制</a></p>"},"terms":{"title":"使用条款","body":"<h2>价格记录</h2><p>附近价格帮助比较观察到的商品价格。识别、门店匹配及单位换算可能不完整或错误。记录可能过时；库存、税费、会员条件、促销日期、购买限制及包装差异都可能影响结账价格。购买前请核对价签和门店。比价结果不代表预订、商家报价或节省金额保证。</p><h2>账户与上传</h2><p>请保护账户访问安全，只上传有权且获准分享的照片。不得伪造价签、冒充门店、上传违法内容或滥用服务。照片仍归你所有；你允许我们及服务商为识别、比价和问题调查存储及处理照片。确认扫描可分享通过验证的价格记录和公开门店位置，具体见隐私政策。原始照片不会公开发布。</p><h2>已确认的价格事实</h2><p>确认价格记录后，你授予 IDEASpike 非独占、免版税的许可，仅为运营和改进 Prices Nearby 而托管、使用、更正、汇总、分析和发布商品、商店、价格、包装或单位、适用价格条件及观察时间等事实。此许可不允许公开展示原始照片、账户身份或精确拍摄坐标。删除账户会移除与你关联的价格贡献。独立来源的价格和其他贡献者的记录不受影响。</p><h2>检查与可用性</h2><p>未检测到价签的扫描会结束，不提供手工商品或价格提交。检查标记和修正用于发现错误，不保证结果准确。功能依赖受支持的 iOS、网络及服务商。</p><h2>点数与付费结果</h2><p>当前应用支持预付点数。识别和提交价格记录免费。某次扫描在交付符合条件的更低价格比价结果时使用 1 点；没有更低价格、结果不可用或仅提交诊断反馈时不扣点。重新打开或刷新已经付过点数的扫描不会再次扣点。确认前请查看显示的结果访问操作。比价结果不保证零售商兑现某条价格记录。</p><p>使用点数不会延长或重新开始云端保存期限。已完成的比价结果保存在受保护的本地扫描历史中，再次查看不扣点数。云端或照片缓存清理不会删除这些结果。退出登录会隐藏该账户的历史；删除账户、清除本地数据或卸载应用会移除它们。购买恢复不会重建已删除的本地历史。</p><h2>购买、到账与退款</h2><p>当前商品目录提供一次性消耗型 10 点包，Apple 显示可购买的价格和币种。这不是订阅。已购买点数不会因时间经过或不活跃而到期；点数是服务使用单位，不是存款或投资。交易验证后，点数发放到购买时使用的应用账户。到账中断时，请在联网状态下使用同一应用账户重新打开应用，系统会自动重试；重试不会重复发放同一交易，也不会恢复已使用点数。不要通过重复购买解决已完成的付款问题。退款可在 reportaproblem.apple.com 向 Apple 申请，是否符合条件取决于 Apple 政策和适用法律。Apple 撤销某次购买时，服务会移除该次购买中尚未使用的点数，不会扣除其他购买的点数或产生负余额。反馈问题本身不是退款申请。删除账户不会自动申请退款、转移点数或恢复余额。未使用已购点数的相关请求按适用购买条件和法律处理。</p><h2>许可与知识产权</h2><p>通过 App Store 下载的应用，除非 App Store Connect 已为你所在国家或地区指定自定义最终用户许可协议，否则其应用许可受 Apple 标准最终用户许可协议约束。本条款补充适用的许可协议，并规范 IDEASpike 提供的账户、在线服务、应用内容和付费权益（如有）。在该协议和本条款约束下，IDEASpike 授予你仅为预定用途使用服务的有限、个人且不可转让许可。应用、软件、设计及所提供内容的全部权利由 IDEASpike 及其许可方保留。</p><h2>服务变更与联系</h2><p>IDEASpike 可更新、暂停或停止服务。可行时，计划永久停止运营前会提前作出合理通知，并停止销售新点数。在法律允许的范围内，服务按可用状态提供，除本条款明确约定或法律要求外，不作出额外保证；对于依赖价格记录或服务中断造成的间接或后果性损失，IDEASpike 不承担责任。服务变更或停止运营不排除未使用的已付费点数或未提供服务所适用的合同及法定补救权利。App Store 退款申请遵循 Apple 流程。本条款不排除依法不得排除的责任或消费者权利。更新会在本页发布；购买、访问或删除协助请联系 support@ideaspike.com。</p><h2>商店资料许可</h2><p>商店目录包含依 Open Database License 提供的 OpenStreetMap 资料。查看 <a href=\\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\\">OpenStreetMap 署名</a>与 <a href=\\"https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/\\">ODbL 1.0 许可</a>。目录匹配不代表零售商认可。</p>"},"support":{"title":"附近价格支持","body":"<h2>Good Price Nearby</h2><p>拍摄完整商品价签来比较附近价格。让价签在虚线框附近清晰可读；识别仍覆盖整张照片。未检测到价签时会结束扫描。</p><h2>历史与门店匹配</h2><p>拍照记录可重新打开保存在本设备上的已完成比价结果，不再扣点。云端或照片缓存清理不会移除这些已保存结果。退出登录会隐藏该账户的历史。清除本地数据、删除账户或移除应用会移除本地历史；恢复购买不会重建本地历史。有上限的本地照片缓存可减少重复下载。照片 GPS 优先于当前手机位置。可见店名和门店地址参与匹配。没有照片 GPS 时，应用会使用手机位置，自动采用现有证据下的最佳支持门店匹配，相邻门店也不要求确认。定位提示仅供参考，匹配结果不代表门店证明。提交修正前请先检查。</p><h2>点数与购买帮助</h2><p>打开“点数”查看可用余额及 Apple 当前的 10 点包报价。只有交付更低价格结果才使用 1 点；识别、没有结果的扫描及诊断反馈不扣点。重新打开已付点数的扫描不会再次扣点。到账中断时，请在联网状态下使用同一应用账户重新打开应用，系统会自动重试未完成的购买。等待批准或未验证的交易不代表点数已到账。不要重复购买来处理已有付款。Apple 退款可在 reportaproblem.apple.com 申请。</p><h2>诊断反馈</h2><p>标记错误字段，并在提供此选项时选择“发送反馈”。照片此前已为识别而上传；此操作提交诊断决定和问题信息。“报告已保存”表示报告在本地排队，“报告已收到”表示已送达。重新联网可重试。诊断报告不会公开为已确认价格记录，也不保证获得单独回复。</p><h2>获取帮助</h2><p>请把应用版本及简短问题描述发至 <a href=\\"mailto:support@ideaspike.com\\">support@ideaspike.com</a>。仅在请求调查某次扫描时提供扫描 ID。不要发送密码、登录验证码、银行卡资料或不必要的个人照片。在账户设置中使用“删除账户”，删除账户和相关个人云端数据。如需协助处理未使用的已购点数，可在删除账户前联系客服。仅卸载应用不会删除在线账户。</p>"}},"zh-Hant":{"labels":{"updated":"更新日期：2026 年 11 月 15 日","operator":"營運者：IDEASpike。聯絡："},"privacy":{"title":"隱私政策","body":"<h2>App 提供什麼</h2><p>附近價格讀取商品價牌並比較附近的價格記錄。上傳照片僅供所屬帳號查看。你確認掃描後，通過驗證的商品、價格、條件、觀察時間及公開門市位置可能出現在其他使用者的比價結果中。原始照片和精確拍攝座標不會在這些結果中顯示。</p><h2>處理的資訊</h2><p>我們處理用於登入的電子郵件和帳號識別、你選擇或拍攝的照片、掃描時間與時區、照片附帶的 GPS，以及拍攝或選圖時可用的手機位置。辨識結果、門市配對、修正及回饋與掃描記錄關聯。服務識別、錯誤、處理時間和模型用量用於執行及排查問題。Apple 商品和交易資訊、點數購買、餘額變動及已付點數的結果記錄用於購買到帳、扣點和防止詐欺。我們不從 Apple 接收銀行卡資料。</p><h2>服務商與定位</h2><p>AWS 提供帳號認證、受保護照片儲存和門市配對。門市配對使用 OpenStreetMap 和 AWS 定位服務；位置資訊可能傳送給 AWS。OpenAI 處理已移除嵌入中繼資料的照片副本，辨識商品和價格資訊。原始 GPS 座標不會傳送給 OpenAI，但照片畫面中可見的資訊會包含在請求中。服務商的使用和保留方式遵循 OpenAI API 資料控制。處理可能發生在你所在國家以外，包括美國。手機定位可選，僅在使用 App 時使用；拒絕手機定位不會移除所選照片中已有的位置資訊。系統選圖器只存取所選照片。</p><h2>保存期限與本機快取</h2><p>雲端照片及其儲存版本安排在 90 天後到期。掃描記錄、回饋和個人價格貢獻最多保存一年。服務診斷通常保存 30 天。帳號資訊和點數餘額在帳號存續期間保留；日常資料清理不會讓已購買點數到期。帳號刪除請求被接受後，帳號將不能繼續使用，相關個人掃描記錄、價格貢獻和雲端照片版本會在七天內刪除。為記帳、防詐欺和處理 Apple 交易而保留的少量購買及退款記錄，使用單向帳號參照，不包含電郵、使用者名稱、照片、位置或比價快照。受保護的災難復原備份可能保留最多 35 天；復原的資料在重新投入使用前必須再次套用刪除要求。</p><p>本機照片快取按帳號隔離，上限為 64 MiB，滿額時清理舊快取，不按固定天數到期。照片受到保護、不參與備份，並在登出或刪除帳號時清理。App 不會把照片加入系統照片圖庫。已完成的比價結果單獨保存在受保護且不參與備份的本機掃描歷史中。登出會隱藏該帳號的歷史；記錄會保留到刪除帳號、清除本機資料或移除 App。雲端或照片快取清理不會刪除已保存的比價結果。</p><h2>你的選擇與協助</h2><p>首次向 OpenAI 傳送新照片前，App 會針對目前裝置上登入的帳號徵求明確許可。取消不會上傳照片。你可以拒絕手機定位、標記錯誤資訊或登出。請僅使用有權分享的照片，避免包含人物或不必要的個人資訊。在「設定 → 帳號 → 刪除帳號」中發起刪除，並確認密碼和最終警告。App 會明確顯示請求已接受，然後登出。刪除會移除你的個人掃描、照片和關聯價格貢獻，獨立採集的價格及其他貢獻者的記錄不受影響。未使用點數將無法繼續存取；刪除不會申請 Apple 退款或轉移點數。移除 App 會清理本機檔案，但不會刪除線上記錄。關於存取、更正或隱私問題，請聯絡 support@ideaspike.com；我們可能核驗帳號控制權。適用的隱私權利仍然有效。</p><h2>可選診斷回饋</h2><p>你可提交掃描問題和修正，協助排查問題。傳送此回饋與上傳照片或確認價格記錄是不同操作，不會發布價格記錄，也不扣點數。尚未傳送的回饋可能保留在裝置上，直至傳送或移除。</p><h2>其他服務與更新</h2><p>App 不包含廣告或跨 App 追蹤 SDK。Apple 的 App Store 及裝置服務適用其自身政策。開啟網站連結會將一般網頁請求資訊傳送至目標網站；你傳給支援信箱的資訊用於回覆。處理方式改變時會更新本 App 專屬政策。 如需瞭解我們的隱私處理方式及服務商的相關政策和做法，包括境外處理，請透過 support@ideaspike.com 聯絡 IDEASpike 隱私聯絡人。</p>\\n<p><a href=\\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/your-data\\">OpenAI API 資料控制</a></p>"},"terms":{"title":"使用條款","body":"<h2>價格記錄</h2><p>附近價格協助比較觀察到的商品價格。辨識、門市配對及單位換算可能不完整或錯誤。記錄可能過時；庫存、稅費、會員條件、促銷日期、購買限制及包裝差異都可能影響結帳價格。購買前請核對價牌和門市。比價結果不代表預訂、商家報價或節省金額保證。</p><h2>帳號與上傳</h2><p>請保護帳號存取安全，只上傳有權且獲准分享的照片。不得偽造價牌、冒充門市、上傳違法內容或濫用服務。照片仍歸你所有；你允許我們及服務商為辨識、比價和問題調查儲存及處理照片。確認掃描可分享通過驗證的價格記錄和公開門市位置，詳見隱私政策。原始照片不會公開發佈。</p><h2>已確認的價格事實</h2><p>確認價格記錄後，你授予 IDEASpike 非獨占、免版稅的許可，僅為營運和改進 Prices Nearby 而託管、使用、更正、彙整、分析和發布商品、商店、價格、包裝或單位、適用價格條件及觀察時間等事實。此許可不允許公開展示原始照片、帳號身分或精確拍攝座標。刪除帳號會移除與你關聯的價格貢獻。獨立來源的價格和其他貢獻者的記錄不受影響。</p><h2>檢查與可用性</h2><p>未偵測到價牌的掃描會結束，不提供手工商品或價格提交。檢查標記和修正用於發現錯誤，不保證結果準確。功能依賴受支援的 iOS、網路及服務商。</p><h2>點數與付費結果</h2><p>目前 App 支援預付點數。辨識和提交價格記錄免費。某次掃描在交付符合條件的更低價格比價結果時使用 1 點；沒有更低價格、結果不可用或僅提交診斷回饋時不扣點。重新開啟或重新整理已經付過點數的掃描不會再次扣點。確認前請查看顯示的結果存取操作。比價結果不保證零售商兌現某條價格記錄。</p><p>使用點數不會延長或重新開始雲端保存期限。已完成的比價結果保存在受保護的本機掃描歷史中，再次查看不扣點數。雲端或照片快取清理不會刪除這些結果。登出會隱藏該帳號的歷史；刪除帳號、清除本機資料或移除 App 會移除它們。購買復原不會重建已刪除的本機歷史。</p><h2>購買、到帳與退款</h2><p>目前商品目錄提供一次性消耗型 10 點包，Apple 顯示可購買的價格和幣別。這不是訂閱。已購買點數不會因時間經過或不活躍而到期；點數是服務使用單位，不是存款或投資。交易驗證後，點數發放到購買時使用的 App 帳號。到帳中斷時，請在連線狀態下使用同一 App 帳號重新開啟 App，系統會自動重試；重試不會重複發放同一交易，也不會復原已使用點數。不要透過重複購買解決已完成的付款問題。退款可在 reportaproblem.apple.com 向 Apple 申請，是否符合條件取決於 Apple 政策和適用法律。Apple 撤銷某次購買時，服務會移除該次購買中尚未使用的點數，不會扣除其他購買的點數或產生負餘額。回報問題本身不是退款申請。刪除帳號不會自動申請退款、轉移點數或復原餘額。未使用已購點數的相關請求按適用購買條件和法律處理。</p><h2>授權與智慧財產權</h2><p>透過 App Store 下載的 App，除非 App Store Connect 已為你所在國家或地區指定自訂最終使用者授權協議，否則其 App 授權受 Apple 標準最終使用者授權協議約束。本條款補充適用的授權協議，並規範 IDEASpike 提供的帳號、線上服務、App 內容及付費權益（如有）。在該協議及本條款約束下，IDEASpike 授予你僅為預定用途使用服務的有限、個人且不可轉讓授權。App、軟體、設計及所提供內容的全部權利由 IDEASpike 及其授權方保留。</p><h2>服務變更與聯絡</h2><p>IDEASpike 可更新、暫停或停止服務。可行時，計劃永久停止營運前會提前作出合理通知，並停止銷售新點數。在法律允許的範圍內，服務按可用狀態提供，除本條款明確約定或法律要求外，不作出額外保證；對於依賴價格記錄或服務中斷造成的間接或後果性損失，IDEASpike 不承擔責任。服務變更或停止營運不排除未使用的已付費點數或未提供服務所適用的合約及法定補救權利。App Store 退款申請遵循 Apple 流程。本條款不排除依法不得排除的責任或消費者權利。更新會在本頁發布；購買、存取或刪除協助請聯絡 support@ideaspike.com。</p><h2>商店資料授權</h2><p>商店目錄包含依 Open Database License 提供的 OpenStreetMap 資料。查看 <a href=\\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\\">OpenStreetMap 署名</a>與 <a href=\\"https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/\\">ODbL 1.0 授權</a>。目錄比對不代表零售商認可。</p>"},"support":{"title":"附近價格支援","body":"<h2>Good Price Nearby</h2><p>拍攝完整商品價牌來比較附近價格。讓價牌在虛線框附近清晰可讀；辨識仍涵蓋整張照片。未偵測到價牌時會結束掃描。</p><h2>歷史與門市配對</h2><p>拍照記錄可重新開啟儲存在本裝置上的已完成比價結果，不再扣點。雲端或照片快取清理不會移除這些已儲存結果。登出會隱藏該帳號的歷史。清除本機資料、刪除帳號或移除 App 會移除本機歷史；復原購買不會重建本機歷史。有上限的本機照片快取可減少重複下載。照片 GPS 優先於目前手機位置。可見店名和門市地址參與配對。沒有照片 GPS 時，App 會使用手機位置，自動採用現有證據下的最佳支援門市配對，相鄰門市也不要求確認。定位提示僅供參考，配對結果不代表門市證明。提交修正前請先檢查。</p><h2>點數與購買協助</h2><p>開啟「點數」查看可用餘額及 Apple 目前的 10 點包報價。只有交付更低價格結果才使用 1 點；辨識、沒有結果的掃描及診斷回饋不扣點。重新開啟已付點數的掃描不會再次扣點。到帳中斷時，請在連線狀態下使用同一 App 帳號重新開啟 App，系統會自動重試未完成的購買。等待批准或未驗證的交易不代表點數已到帳。不要重複購買來處理已有付款。Apple 退款可在 reportaproblem.apple.com 申請。</p><h2>診斷回饋</h2><p>標記錯誤欄位，並在提供此選項時選擇「傳送回饋」。照片先前已為辨識而上傳；此操作提交診斷決定和問題資訊。「報告已儲存」表示報告在本機排隊，「報告已收到」表示已送達。重新連線可重試。診斷報告不會公開為已確認價格記錄，也不保證取得個別回覆。</p><h2>取得協助</h2><p>請將 App 版本及簡短問題描述傳至 <a href=\\"mailto:support@ideaspike.com\\">support@ideaspike.com</a>。僅在請求調查某次掃描時提供掃描 ID。不要傳送密碼、登入驗證碼、銀行卡資料或不必要的個人照片。在帳號設定中使用「刪除帳號」，刪除帳號和相關個人雲端資料。如需協助處理未使用的已購點數，可在刪除帳號前聯絡客服。僅移除 App 不會刪除線上帳號。</p>"}}}')}}]);